{"id": "EUVD-2026-59727", "enisaUuid": "95d55632-b3d1-33d9-95d6-92ac6714f646", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: fix refcounting of iso_conn\n\niso_conn_del() and iso_chan_del() have a race that results to double-put\nof iso_conn:\n\n    [Task hdev->workqueue]         [Task 2]\n    iso_conn_del                   iso_chan_del\n      iso_conn_hold_unless_zero      iso_conn_lock\n      iso_conn_lock                  conn->sk = NULL\n                                     iso_conn_unlock\n      sk = iso_sock_hold(conn)  <---------\u00b4\n      if (!sk) iso_conn_put          iso_conn_put\n      iso_conn_put /* UAF */\n\nThe extra put for !sk in iso_conn_del() is currently required since\nfailing iso_chan_add() may leave iso_conn not associated with any sk.\n\nFix by having iso_pi(sk)->conn own refcount when non-NULL, so\niso_conn_del does not need to put it.  Adjust the iso_conn_add()\nrefcounting so that conn is put if it does not get associated with an\nsk.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T12:27:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T08:20:16", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42c8bd6ac81e21200bb90f1eaf43d19352eec6d7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3b921533e8aa95b77aadcf31737595578e735f3c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8208b4939afb0a1977fffe902c3ca42fe0f3baaa", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fdfde532ab1caa165fcd8985001157ac8b4db365"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f45g-2gpw-92wg", "CVE-2026-74534"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "028b2fcf-7f6a-3f21-9afe-073ec32d5c51", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.11.11 <6.12"}, {"id": "26150901-d8b2-3a6f-81c2-88ce8566ce6d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f53e7489273dc2bb307bf50f319b3762d45534f0"}, {"id": "372c756b-7540-3210-aa9c-83aa08ae52c2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <3b921533e8aa95b77aadcf31737595578e735f3c"}, {"id": "385bcc09-03b7-3125-a179-31c27fc4196c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "5851dcaf-029b-3aee-8656-78a9b02b7627", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.2 <6.12.113"}, {"id": "63743bc3-202f-3298-84ea-fa50b4c9e137", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.113"}, {"id": "6ced5dc9-838a-3f0e-b5f1-16aefdcbe263", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a58d0f5dac322e16cc75334d000666512341bde5 <42c8bd6ac81e21200bb90f1eaf43d19352eec6d7"}, {"id": "8d7e5ca5-4b6a-3e6e-a95a-3dfa03eb7543", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.44"}, {"id": "d26b2ee4-babd-3290-a50c-dc970ddc818c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.8"}, {"id": "d2825160-2b25-3c73-9f19-699fef7dab7f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "e59feae2-db64-374a-94c7-bf9e6ffeccf1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <fdfde532ab1caa165fcd8985001157ac8b4db365"}, {"id": "ee1650be-9273-350b-ba15-f9adad7f4144", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "f8cc4824-7313-3ee7-b3bb-fbbc38e8bb4c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <8208b4939afb0a1977fffe902c3ca42fe0f3baaa"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e5b23fb8-9c2d-3a34-aa02-7e67e01ac537", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}